Package: pixelfilter
Type: Package
Title: Simple Colour Filters for Images
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Theodora", "Sylaidi", email = "theodora.sylaidi.2@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads an image and changes the colour of every pixel.
    Can make a grey, red, green or blue image, or a two colour cut-off image.
    Includes a real fluorescence staining image and a function to measure
    how much of the image is stained.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    magick,
    grDevices
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
URL: https://github.com/theodorasylaidy-lab/pixelfilter
BugReports: https://github.com/theodorasylaidy-lab/pixelfilter/issues
